t":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"s_uuOfUsRMr8jxr1ofsE-Q","review_id":"tjpD-Q7g3eKAzsS_a1Wilg","date":"2020-12-26T20:54:34","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9174998998641968,"text_excerpt":"After a long Christmas Day we decided to order in and wanted some Chinese food. We both wanted general tso's chicken and enjoyed the options given for rice (shrimp fried rice, chicken fried rice, pork fried rice, or white rice). I got the pork fried rice and they threw in a pork eggroll. The pork fried rice, broccoli, and chicken were all very delicious and it's a generous serving (I'll easily have three servings of food). We also got an order of pork fried dumplings which were also good. We've never dined in but have ordered from them through delivery apps a few times and have always enjoyed the food. Will definitely order from them again."},{"business_id":"s_uuOfUsRMr8jxr1ofsE-Q","review_id":"oXhTAocIicg5G29Ovwh3mw","date":"2012-12-05T17:28:52","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9151179194450378,"text_excerpt":"I have really warmed up to this place over the last year. We have tried a variety of things on the menu, all completely satisfactory, but MY favorite thing lately has been the Chinese Vegetables in Garlic Sauce. Any time I am needing some fast, yummy lunch, this is where I go. For less than $8 I can get lots of fresh vegetables and enough for two meals!!"},{"business_id":"s_uuOfUsRMr8jxr1ofsE-Q","review_id":"IfHgEuXKaLf01ZFDfk71VQ","date":"2019-04-18T13:31:01","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9145503640174866,"text_excerpt":"This is my go to Chinese spot. The prices are right, the food always comes out hot, and very fast. I usually get general tso chicken. I also like there crab rangoon they are big and filled nicely. The food is good and always fresh. Obviously it's a small joint so don't expect luxury."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"s_uuOfUsRMr8jxr1ofsE-Q","photo_id":"23FaJ-455jBAcrGLGBas0Q","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/23FaJ-455jBAcrGLGBas0Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":1.0}]},"notebook_case":null}
